cacheon/vendor_provenance.json.

Optional object-store support (`pip install -e ".[object-store]"`) uses
boto3/botocore (Apache-2.0) against S3-compatible APIs. Hippius is configured
as one endpoint/region preset in cacheon/object_store.py; no Hippius or other
provider SDK source is vendored.
